    "name": "FoundX - Campus Lost and Found API",
    "description": "Phase 1 API tests for the FoundX Campus Lost and Found Portal.\n\nHOW TO USE\n1. Import this file into Postman (File -> Import).\n2. Set the collection variable `baseUrl` to your server, e.g. http://localhost:4000 or https://your-service.onrender.com\n3. Run the whole collection with the Collection Runner (top-left of the collection -> Run).\n\nThe Login request stores the access token automatically, so the protected requests that follow work without copy-pasting anything. Logout revokes it on purpose, so the last request proves the token is dead.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
